# Build & Deploy

Run the PowerShell script at the repo root — it SSHes into the build host, runs `yarn build`, then copies the output directly to Home Assistant over the network share:

```powershell
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File "\\192.168.20.143\zigbee2mqtt-networkmap\build_and_deploy.ps1"
```

## What it does

1. **Build** — SSHes to `engelch@192.168.20.143`, runs `yarn build` in `~/dev/zigbee2mqtt-networkmap`
2. **Deploy** — Copies `dist/zigbee2mqtt-networkmap.js` to `\\192.168.20.204\config\www\ce-zigbee-networkmap\`

Aborts automatically if the build fails.
